    "sections": {
        "description": "Apartment Blocks is a modern, responsive, and feature-rich theme designed for real estate websites, residential complexes, apartment living, housing projects, condos, rental units, apartment complexes, tenant services, leasing platforms, property listings, and property management businesses. Ideal for showcasing apartment listings, rental properties, real estate portfolios, property details, floor plans, amenities, and neighborhood highlights, it features customizable banners, property grids, gallery sections, and call-to-action areas. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for selling property guides, digital brochures, or booking services, Contact Form 7 for inquiries and tenant applications, and Yoast SEO for search optimization, the theme ensures a professional, user-friendly, and conversion-focused online presence. With easy customization of layouts, colors, and fonts, and a fully responsive design for mobile and tablet devices, Apartment Blocks provides a complete solution for real estate agents, property developers, and rental managers to present properties effectively and attract clients. Demo: https://trial.ovationthemes.com/apartment-blocks/"
    },
